  "body": "## Two exact source scopes\n\nStatus: already_solved, one substantive author turn. The standard physical-class conjecture is a credited prior resolution: m_ADM \u2264 m_CV \u2264 m_iso = m_ADM for smooth complete one-ended AF three-manifolds with nonnegative scalar curvature and empty/minimal compact boundary. Benatti\u2013Fogagnolo\u2013Mazzieri2023 Theorem5.6 supplies the upper comparison; no topology hypothesis is silently dropped from their separate Theorem1.3. The sign-sensitive proof step and later correction are explicitly qualified.\n\nThe unrestricted all-AF wording is false: a smooth complete boundaryless compact fill of a mass\u22122 Schwarzschild end admits nested off-center balls with capacity exactly R\u22121 and volume radius R\u221211/4+O(R\u207b\u00b9). Thus m_CV\u2265\u22127/4>\u22122=m_ADM. This does not evaluate the global m_CV or contradict the physical-class theorem. Jauregui's harmonic-capacity identity and classical Newton potential are credited; historical novelty is unverified.\n\n## Review and reproduction\n\nFull separate AI-assisted source/proof audit passed. All ten frozen author files and four frozen review files are unchanged. The original source page and seven primary PDFs were checked locally and are not redistributed. 5,529 author and 3,128 independent exact controls pass. Additive portable wrappers make source-PDF hashes optional while retaining the same mathematical checks.\n\nSee problems/30004811_capacity_volume_mass/PUBLICATION_README.md and review/REVIEW.md.\n\n## Integration\n\nFresh main first parent, frozen WIP1901d52ea8b47b4dd3c843cb2e02be2c520da7cb second parent. Only target artifacts and own QUEUE status/turn cells change. Draft only, no merge/release or CI-pass claim.",
